H.3.5 CARE OF MINOR BURNS (SMALL FIRST AND SECOND DEGREE BURNS)
For minor burns (small first and second degree burns) you can use fresh aloe vera or honey if
available to cover the burn wound. This will help the wound to heal faster. H.3.5.1 HYGIENE
